WEBVTT

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.370
Hey, that looks good. The daily special?

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.080
Yes. When it comes to lunch,

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.550
the cafeteria's daily special 
is definitely the way to go.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.390
It's completely satisfactory in 
terms of both value and flavor.

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:18.700
You've been getting bread a lot, En-chan.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.340
Yeah. Everything else is just a pain.

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.400
You should have some vegetables, too.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.900
Want some of this stew?

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.520
Yumoto, is something wrong?

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.580
I don't seem to have any appetite.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.810
What?!

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:43.170
It's unusual for you to have no appetite...

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:47.460
And today's the day my brother 
Gora makes lunch for me, too...

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:51.660
I guess unusual things do happen.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:57.950
Huh? Now that I look closer, En-chan-senpai, 
you have really long eyelashes...

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.580
Atsushi, he's acting weird.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:02.130
Yeah, weird.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:04.080
Oh, look out!

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:06.320
Megawacchi...

00:01:06.320 --> 00:01:08.750
Huh? Yumoto-kun, your face is red.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.420
Now that you mention it...

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:11.760
Megawacchi?

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:17.450
<b>Megawa Rui</b>

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.580
I'm Yumoto-kun's classmate, Megawa Rui.

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.660
I'm the manager of the baseball club.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:20.060
Nice to meet you!

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.300
R-Right...

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:26.240
Yumoto-kun, do you have a cold? 
They're going around lately.

00:01:26.710 --> 00:01:30.450
But I've never caught a cold in my life.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.990
Why don't we check your temperature? Hang on.

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:34.650
Here, a thermometer.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.150
He's a manager, all right.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.790
37°C?

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:42.800
Huh?

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.550
Wow! I've never reached 37°C before!

00:01:46.550 --> 00:01:49.240
No wonder I feel so lightheaded!

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.320
You feel lightheaded?

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.200
Yep. And it's throbbing, too.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.190
It does sound like a cold, then.

00:01:56.190 --> 00:02:00.020
But I've never seen anyone 
so happy about geting a cold.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:05.050
Atsushi, Yumoto really is acting weird.

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:06.480
Yeah, he is.

00:02:06.740 --> 00:02:08.710
Yumoto-kun, why not leave early?

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:11.110
Maybe you should just get some rest today.

00:02:11.110 --> 00:02:14.450
Yay! Leave early! Hooray!

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.450
Hey, Megawa.

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.360
Yes?

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.530
Well, I'll be going now. Take care!

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:23.330
Bye-bye, Megawacchi!

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:26.320
He seems like the really pleasant type.

00:02:26.320 --> 00:02:28.300
I bet he's really popular.

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:30.130
Bye-bye!

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:34.890
<i>That's right. I have a very good,
pleasant disposition.</i>

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:38.570
<i>I'm the #1 glasses boy first-year student 
that everyone wants as their manager.</i>

00:02:38.570 --> 00:02:42.090
<i>In terms of cuteness, I'm easily a 
match for any glasses-girl character.</i>

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:18.860
Love is Glasses...

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:25.080
It seems like Yumoto-kun has a cold, 
so we brought him home.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.780
What? Yumoto has a cold?

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.500
That's right.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:31.690
He has a fever of 37°C.

00:04:31.690 --> 00:04:33.090
A fever?!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.370
Heat up a bath! A bath!

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.210
It's heated. This is a public bath, y'know.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.060
Ice! Go to the snowy mountains to pick up ice!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.850
Isn't there ice in the freezer?

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.800
Where did "snowy mountains" 
come from, anyway?

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:47.270
That's right, onions!

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:48.680
For a cold, you need onions!

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:50.470
Cooked onions!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.280
I don't get it.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.530
Why onions?

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:58.430
Big bro Gora always says 
onions are good for a fever.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:00.000
Really?

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:02.150
Is that a folk remedy or something?

00:05:05.620 --> 00:05:06.870
How's that, Yumoto?

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:09.620
Stinks of onions.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.210
That's just fine.

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.130
I think I'm getting sleepy.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.180
Sleep.

00:05:15.790 --> 00:05:16.700
Okay.

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.790
Kind of a strange sight, isn't it?

00:05:20.790 --> 00:05:22.550
I get what you mean.

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:27.010
My little brother has never once caught a cold.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.890
He must be overexerting himself somehow.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.920
Well, he may have been a 
little busy with club activities.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:37.080
That doesn't explain such a high fever.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:38.560
No, it's a mild fever.

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.980
I think it's just an ordinary cold, myself.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:43.310
A cold is a gateway to all kinds of illnesses.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:45.180
For this to happen on my watch...

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:50.300
It's okay, big brother. The fever's low.

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:53.550
But I really am worried. 
For Yumoto to be stuck in bed...

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.820
They say fools don't catch colds, after all.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.580
He said it out loud!

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.590
Yumoto, your big brother will save you!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:09.410
That was some pretty 
amazing brotherly love, huh?

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.940
I guess the Yumoto doesn't fall far from the tree.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.230
Such a moving sight!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:17.940
The reason Yumoto-san so
passionately dedicates himself to love

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:21.900
is because of the deep love from his 
brother that envelops him every day!

00:06:21.900 --> 00:06:26.200
Oh, how I wish I could scout that 
brother for the Earth Defense Club!

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:27.830
You're <i>that </i>impressed?

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.020
That's some show of emotion.

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:32.240
I'm absolutely welling over with emotion!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.910
Although I am concerned 
about Yumoto-san's fever...

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.910
Yo!

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.310
Good morning.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.220
Hey.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:42.170
Morning.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:43.890
Good day to you.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:49.220
Senpai. Good day to you.

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:50.890
"Good day to you"?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.180
What's with the glasses?

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:55.060
Everything near me suddenly appeared too close.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.730
Wait, you <i>are</i> Yumoto, right?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:59.030
Yes. I am Hakone Yumoto.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.650
Lovely weather today, isn't it?

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.060
By the way, has your fever gone down?

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.330
I still have a fever,

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.160
but my brother Gora brewed 
some medicinal herbs for me.

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:12.190
I felt so pleasantly refreshed, I decided to come.

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:16.530
But if you still have a fever, 
you should rest, shouldn't you?

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:18.130
Your brother must've been worried, too.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:21.400
I didn't tell him I was leaving, 
so he doesn't know.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.130
On such a pleasant day, 
I simply couldn't stay in bed.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.190
Well, excuse me!

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:30.940
Am I the only one who's bothered by that?

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:33.220
No, I think we're all bothered by that.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.930
Yeah. Yumoto's character has changed, hasn't it?

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:37.820
Do you think the fever knocked a screw loose?

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.230
Yumoto, I cooked some more onion.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.490
Yumoto?

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:50.370
Ah, the gentlemen of the 
Student Council. Good day to you.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.940
Has your morning meeting finished?

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:58.030
Yes.

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:00.950
I'm glad to hear it. You do such fine work.

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.010
Pardon me.

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:05.550
That was that first-year boy 
from the Defense Club, wasn't it?

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:08.350
Yes. He's always been a rather strange boy.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:10.170
Don't be led astray by fools.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.970
Every minute spent thinking 
about them is wasted.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.350
That's true.

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:14.340
Harsh.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.110
Oh, Megawacchi. Good day to you.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.240
Are you working hard at your 
morning practice as always?

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.020
Yeah.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.240
Yumoto-kun, are you feeling better now?

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:30.540
Yes. Thank you for yesterday.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:32.700
Well, I'll be going to the classroom now.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.500
<b>Earth Defense Club                         (lol)</b>

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.080
What brought this on all of a sudden?

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.690
I've been concerned about 
the mess for some time.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:01.610
You have?

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:04.060
Magnificent, Yumoto-san!

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.020
Cleaning is love that goes by the name "service"!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.540
Yes!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.760
What happened to him?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:12.910
I don't know.

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:16.110
But his character has 
completely changed, hasn't it?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.020
Yeah.

00:09:17.020 --> 00:09:19.200
Actually, remember what his brother said?

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.110
"A cold is a gateway to all kinds of illnesses."

00:09:21.570 --> 00:09:23.540
What about it?

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:27.580
You don't think Yumoto is 
going though <i>that</i>, do you?

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:33.210
The first fever he's had since he 
was born has overloaded his brain?!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:36.080
That's not possible. It was only 37°C.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.380
But it might not be out of the question.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:42.060
Yes. Maybe this is exactly what his 
brother was afraid would happen.

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.140
Now...

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.900
Teacher, I'll clean you up nicely, too.

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:49.940
What will we do if he stays like this?

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.240
Scary.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:54.040
But I wonder if he even <i>can </i>
go back to the old Yumoto.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:56.080
I don't know...

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:59.000
I think things are better this way.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.940
When all is said and done, 
he's overflowing with love!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:05.160
What happened?

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:08.300
I was cleaning up, and the bookcase fell apart.

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.250
Oh, this was in pretty bad shape.

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:12.800
But Mr. Tawarayama's been...

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:15.410
Teacher, hang in there!

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:16.680
Wait, he's dead already...

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.260
Hey, look.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.920
I didn't know there was a door here.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.170
Why are we remodeling all of a sudden?

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:30.780
Just a bit of feng shui.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:34.630
I didn't know you were concerned 
with such things, Arima-san.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:35.920
I suppose I am.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:37.150
But...

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:41.640
I didn't know there was a door here.

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.530
Okay! It's all clean!

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:50.310
Well, I'm going to go take out the trash.

00:10:58.660 --> 00:10:59.880
Hello!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:00.810
Huh? Who's that?

00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:04.250
Hello!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.370
Who's that guy?

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.650
That's Hakone Yumoto, the first-year.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:11.730
He seems like a really nice guy.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.190
I wonder if we could get him to be our manager.

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:19.490
It feels so good getting things clean.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.080
Now, then...

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.550
Hakone Yumoto-kun!

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:27.830
Yumoto-kun, would you 
like to become our manager?

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.740
Hold on! We saw him first!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:32.520
No, we saw him first!

00:11:32.520 --> 00:11:33.970
No, we did!

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.730
I'm sorry.

00:11:35.730 --> 00:11:40.150
I'm grateful for your invitations, 
but I have the Defense Club.

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.430
Please let me do my best where I am now.

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.690
So cute!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.520
Yumoto-kun, join our club!

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.420
Please, Yumoto-kun!

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.310
You're welcome with us!

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.770
I told you, I can't.

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:56.690
He's really popular.

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.570
Is he really that good a guy?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.070
You think we could get him to be our manager?

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:08.160
Oh, I didn't mean that we don't need you...

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:11.550
Yeah. You do a great job, Megawa.

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:15.000
I-It's okay. You don't have to defend me.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.260
It's my own fault for getting complacent,

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:20.220
thinking I was the only 
popular glasses character around.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:30.680
His heart appears to be muddied by 
panic, jealousy, and self-loathing.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:32.480
Yes. I like him.

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.060
Not bad.

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:36.740
What do you think, Lord Zundar?

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.890
Fine, indeed.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:44.460
He shall be our next target!

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.620
Go, Caerula Adamas!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:48.660
Yes, Lord Zundar!

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.680
<i>Yumoto-kun...</i>

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:59.020
<i>You rocketed to the position of first-year 
student most desired as a manager.</i>

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:00.420
<i>I envy you...</i>

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.420
<i>No, I loathe you...</i>

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.510
<i>That should be my position!</i>

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:16.890
<b>Gero Akoya
Born April 24th
Blood Type B / Taurus
Hobbies: Aromatherapy
Likes: Beautiful things,
macarons</b>

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:21.540
Senpai!

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:23.700
Yumoto. Where have you been?

00:13:24.020 --> 00:13:27.920
A whole lot of sports clubs have
asked me to be their manager.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:31.920
But my love for the Defense Club hasn't changed.

00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:36.520
Am I the only one who found 
Yumoto really cute just now?

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.280
I thought so, too. Damn.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:41.760
Well, I've always thought 
he was cute, as a kouhai.

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:43.600
Yes, but only as a kouhai.

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.010
No!

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:53.610
The position of #1 boy in terms of
pleasant, cute, and manager material,

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:56.450
or PCM for short, is mine!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.610
One of these, huh?

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.830
But were you aware of "PCM"?

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:04.170
No. And I don't understand what it means.

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:06.400
Yeah. I can't get excited about this.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:09.140
Don't be like that! Come on, everyone!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:11.540
Love Making into the Battle Lovers!

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:12.980
For heaven's sake...

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.440
Love Making.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:21.380
You, who befoul our beloved Earth!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:24.130
No justice can come from loveless power!

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:26.390
Love is all!

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.900
Live for love! Die for love!

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.840
Wait, Scarlet's missing!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.270
He's still over there!

00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:37.400
Give back my position!

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.520
PCM Beam!

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:41.490
Look out!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.860
What's wrong, Yumoto? Transform already!

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.090
I can't "transform."

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:50.290
No, no, no...

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.790
You've done it plenty of times!

00:14:52.180 --> 00:14:53.740
You even took the initiative.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:54.500
Yeah.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.860
But I'm scared! Senpai, save me!

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.230
What do we do about this?

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:02.540
Crap. For a moment there, I actually 
thought about wanting to protect him!

00:15:02.540 --> 00:15:06.120
If it's come to this, we should 
force him to transform!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.360
Please don't!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.940
I don't want to transform! Senpai!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:13.890
Why are you ignoring me to flirt with him?!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:19.330
Epinard Hurricane!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.490
Guys!

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:35.440
That's so mean. Coming at me all at once...

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:38.300
I don't even want to fight!

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.510
Huh?

00:15:39.510 --> 00:15:42.450
He's the one who's overwhelmingly stronger.

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.770
Who the heck is this guy, anyway?

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:49.100
Position-wise, I'm a character 
who should be protected!

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:51.840
I'm not the one who 
should be on the front lines!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.640
And yet... And yet...!

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:00.650
He's really strong!

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:04.380
His reason for fighting is so absurd 
that I can't predict his next move!

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:08.700
Normally, Scarlet would say "It's okay!"
and change the tone of the fight, but...

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.080
Help me!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.610
Yeah, that.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:16.080
Normally, at a time like this, 
the others would come to save me!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:18.690
That's my position, and yet...

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.750
Megawa!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:25.720
Senpai...

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.670
You okay, Megawa?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:28.600
Senpai...

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.940
It's okay now!

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.100
We'll protect you!

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.940
Senpai...

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:38.670
So why do I have to be the one fighting?!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.580
He's so powerful...

00:16:54.260 --> 00:16:55.830
We're going to lose at this rate!

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:56.830
Damn.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:17:00.930
I'm begging you! Please, transform!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.360
I can't. I'm scared.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:07.340
But if this keeps up, your friends 
will be blown to smithereens!

00:17:07.340 --> 00:17:08.290
But...

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:11.630
There's no choice. I'll use my ultimate weapon!

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:15.260
If you transform and fight, 
you may cuddle me as much as you want!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:20.130
Come on! Cuddle me! 
Cuddle me to your heart's content!

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.630
Stop that! It's indecent!

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:26.640
Now, everyone. If you 
don't want me to beat you,

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.260
you should protect me, 
dote on me, be kind to me!

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:33.210
Come on. Come on. Come on!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.790
Just because you say "come on"...

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:37.290
If you don't, I'll beat all of you.

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:40.740
It's gonna hurt! You'll be ripped to shreds!

00:17:41.060 --> 00:17:42.160
Damn.

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.010
Why...?

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:48.980
If you don't want that, 
then love me and only me!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.180
Come on. Come on. Come on!

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.540
This isn't good.

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:01.040
We've never been in a situation this bad!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.270
Come on, dote on me!

00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:06.430
Damn... This is no joke!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.230
We'll never give in!

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:11.400
That's right. We refuse!

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.770
Yeah, we refuse.

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:16.690
We've already got a cute kouhai to dote on.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.160
He means you!

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:22.510
That's right. Our kouhai slot 
has already been filled.

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.560
He's all we need!

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:27.140
And we have no plans to be swayed by another!

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:30.830
Then... Then... I'll beat you all!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:34.160
I really will... I really will beat you all!

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.840
This... This is bad!

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:40.150
They're all... They're all going to be beaten!

00:18:46.010 --> 00:18:47.320
I won't let it...

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.600
I won't let it happen!

00:18:50.260 --> 00:18:51.840
Love Making!

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.520
The Sparkling Prince!

00:18:56.520 --> 00:18:58.660
Battle Lover Scarlet!

00:18:58.990 --> 00:19:01.290
Take this, Glasses Monster!

00:19:07.970 --> 00:19:09.720
Took you long enough.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:10.910
We've been waiting.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:12.630
Shall we do the usual, then?

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:14.680
Sure!

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.770
Let's go, Glasses Monster!

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:22.890
Sparkle, Lumiere of Love!

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.770
Flash, Purifying Aqua!

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:28.280
Pierce, Gallant Hurricane!

00:19:28.280 --> 00:19:30.770
Roar, Raging Gaia!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.280
Thrill, Blazing Ignit!

00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:49.620
Love Attack!

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:56.960
Is cuteness a sin?!

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:05.940
You have a team who needs you, too.

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:09.060
Do your best in the place where you belong.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:13.300
Love Shower!

00:20:18.270 --> 00:20:21.490
What is this warmth?

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:25.130
I see... So this is love.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:32.500
Love is over!

00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:35.970
I'm so happy! You're back to your usual self!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:41.550
Come to think of it, I haven't seen 
Tawarayama with you at all today.

00:20:41.550 --> 00:20:43.030
Are you sure this is okay?

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:44.120
Gulp!

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:46.130
I bet he's completely decomposed.

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:49.040
H-H-He'll be just fine, really.

00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:54.620
Did you get that?

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.850
Perfect.

00:20:57.510 --> 00:21:01.320
Lord Hireashi should be very pleased by this.

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:03.560
Yumoto!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:06.710
Yumoto!

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:08.100
Big bro?

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.660
You shouldn't be here. You still have a fever.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.120
Sorry I came to school without telling you.

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:16.420
You had me worried.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:20.350
Wait, shouldn't our highly 
advanced camouflage prevent him

00:21:20.350 --> 00:21:22.240
from seeing our true identities?

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.640
Does his brother know who we are?

00:21:24.640 --> 00:21:25.800
No way.

00:21:25.800 --> 00:21:28.330
Then how'd he know that was his brother?

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:30.890
Through the power of brotherly love, I guess?

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:37.970
We lost again...

00:21:37.970 --> 00:21:41.860
And there's another strange one among them.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:45.820
That man... Exactly who is he?

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:48.890
Well, Kinosaki-chan?

00:21:48.890 --> 00:21:50.850
Did you get a good shot?

00:21:50.850 --> 00:21:53.140
Did you really?

00:21:53.140 --> 00:21:56.470
Wow, we've been stuck in a rut all this time,

00:21:56.470 --> 00:21:59.290
but this time it's perfect?

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:01.760
Can I really trust you?

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:03.680
Then once you get some good numbers,

00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:07.190
we'll be eating sushi in Ginza, 
if you know what I mean.

00:23:40.820 --> 00:23:44.690
At last, our plan is entering the final phase!

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:46.990
Commander Hireashi, leave this to me.

00:23:46.990 --> 00:23:49.830
I swear I shall bring results 
that meet your expectations!

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:55.160
Next Time

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:55.160
The Trial Called Love

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:52.720
Next time: The Trial Called Love.

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:54.190
Zundar!
